; Layout: panel with a title, static and bound labels, buttons, a field,
; a disabled control, clipping at the screen edge.
SCREEN 32 8
SET who "world"
PANEL main 0 0 32 7 "Layout demo"
LABEL greet 2 1 "Hello,"
LABEL name 9 1 :who
LABEL num 2 2 12345
FIELD entry 2 3 10 save
BUTTON ok 2 5 "OK" save
BUTTON later 9 5 "Later" save
BUTTON edge 28 5 "Clip" save
ON save PU
DISABLE later
